  "counterfactuals": [
    "workspace_panels=true/client_actions=false selects genuine registry/Test type/Test panel and no OpenPanelAction; older-eight real direct-panel Opener API preserved, D2 Recipe is independent workspace_panel_reopening.",
    "D2 reopening=false uses actual direct SFMScreenPanel callback; no recipe import/record/four-argument opener. No stub recipe or mandatory reopening prerequisite.",
    "D2 command_palette=false removes palette imports/unwrapping/close operations. Actual origin host is used directly. No palette feature enabled implicitly.",
    "D2 stack_controls=false refuses focused open with feedback and return 0 in typed callback BEFORE recipe.reopen, plus return0 before mutation in static sourceless API. No fake successful operation.",
    "D2 directional_opening=false refuses directional open with feedback and return0 before recipe.reopen/palette/host mutation; stable Direction enum remains for real callers. No broad caller/registrar dependency change.",
    "D2 stack/direction paths independently call genuine currently selected host overloads with or without Recipe. Stack owner implies actual metadata prerequisite; directional path does not need metadata.",
    "Terminal properties registrar does not require terminal_remote just to expose its real unavailable/Rust-owner check. Its actual panel lookup and UI carrier dependencies remain local. Remote-free genuine isRustBacked=false is not a fabricated provider.",
    "Grammar field belongs to editor_document_panels, not syntax_languages merely because SFML.g4 is its content; released grammar resource remains independently existing.",
    "Candidate timeline constructor is explicitly trajectory_panels+timeline_panels; other history/review factories keep functional ownership and disclosed transitive provider gaps."
  ],
  "remaining_real_blockers": [
    "Only real Test typed factory/panel is authored here. Twenty-three other D2 factory fields have genuine historical classes but most are still unpromoted; never claim full-on Java/registry closure or fake them.",
    "OpenPanelAction's current registrar also references other panel actions (close/focus/maximize/diagnostics); this source is not proof that workspace_panel_actions compiles fully.",
    "Other genuine OpenPanelAction consumers (explorer/review/REPL/symbol/preview) must retain real effect ownership or receive a later reviewed consumer union/pure helper split. This cohort does not silently grant them workspace_panel_actions or widen prerequisites.",
    "HistoryGraph/Candidate/DocumentHistory/Explorer/Review/Release/Chamber/Editor factories need independent optional API factoring (lookup/reopening/history/editor services) before their individual feature masks compile.",
    "Terminal ServiceFactory/ScreenType and typed factory backend/endpoint closure remain real missing providers; no process/network substitute.",
    "Pure carrier current OR refinements need exact current-only action/Choice/UI7 fixture amendments; immutable original ledgers/goldens retained.",
    "Java compilation, Minecraft registry event wiring, typed command execution, UI focus/lifecycle, consent/signing/filesystem/network admission and release/development parity remain untested."
  ],
